  "title": "Oklahoma’s Food Truck Freedom Act: What Vendors Need to Know Before November 1 - The Avocado - Avocado POS",
  "summary": "Starting November 1, 2025, Oklahoma food truck vendors will see a major change in how they operate across the state. The Food Truck Freedom Act now allows vendors to operate anywhere in Oklahoma with a single state food establishment license, while still following local rules.",
